      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Q10. What is the difference between 301, 302, 307 and 308 redirects?",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "`301` and `308` are permanent, `302` and `307` are temporary. `307` and `308` **keep** the method and body.",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Code",
            "Permanent",
            "Keeps method"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "301",
              "yes",
              "no"
            ],
            [
              "302",
              "no",
              "no"
            ],
            [
              "307",
              "no",
              "yes"
            ],
            [
              "308",
              "yes",
              "yes"
            ]
          ],
          "highlightRow": 3,
          "frame": "dashed"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "`308` for an API endpoint that moved for good",
            "`307` for maintenance or a temporary failover",
            "`301` fits only GET pages, such as a website",
            "Every redirect needs a `Location` header"
          ],
          "style": "star",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "green"
        },
        {
          "type": "code",
          "lang": "http",
          "lines": [
            "POST /v1/orders",
            "",
            "HTTP/1.1 308 Permanent Redirect",
            "Location: /v2/orders"
          ],
          "note": "client must repeat the POST body"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "The POST to GET trap",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "kind": "flow",
          "spec": {
            "nodes": [
              {
                "text": "POST /old",
                "sub": "with body",
                "ink": "blue"
              },
              {
                "text": "302",
                "sub": "Location: /new",
                "ink": "orange"
              },
              {
                "text": "GET /new",
                "sub": "body dropped",
                "ink": "red"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Old clients rewrite POST to GET on 301 and 302",
            "The payload is silently lost, no error shown",
            "Use `307` or `308` for any non-GET endpoint",
            "Test redirects with a real POST, not a browser"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "red"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
