          "highlightRow": 2,
          "frame": "dashed"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "tip",
          "title": "Interview tip",
          "text": "Retry 5xx with backoff, never 4xx. Send `Retry-After` on 503."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Redirect caching gotchas",
          "ink": "orange"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Browsers cache `301` and `308` with no expiry",
            "A wrong permanent redirect sticks until cache clears",
            "`302` and `307` are not cached unless told so",
            "CDNs may cache redirects, so set `Cache-Control`"
          ],
          "style": "cross",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "orange"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "style": "sticky",
          "title": "Remember",
          "text": "Pick the code by who must act: client fixes 4xx, server fixes 5xx."
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "text": "Lost updates and 412",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
        {
          "type": "bullets",
          "items": [
            "Client reads the resource and its `ETag`",
            "Client sends `If-Match` with that ETag on PUT",
            "Stale ETag gets `412`, nothing is overwritten",
            "Re-fetch, merge changes, then resend"
          ],
          "style": "number",
          "frame": "dashed",
          "ink": "blue"
        },
